{{!
    @template mod_presenterai/recorder

    The recorder: an optional slide deck, the camera preview or a microphone
    indicator, Record and Stop, the timer and a status line. Behaviour is in
    mod_presenterai/recorder and mod_presenterai/view, which find elements by
    data-region and data-action, so those attributes are the contract.

    The limits line is the published ceiling of plan section 4.4, shown before
    the learner starts. The recording and near-the-limit indicators carry
    words, not only a colour (design section 11, rule 9).

    Where still frames are taken for body language feedback, one sentence of
    static text says so before the learner records (DECISIONS.md Part 1). Where
    the activity offers the D24 opt out, a checkbox follows, with the sentence
    that says ticking it costs no marks directly under it and tied to it by
    aria-describedby. mod_presenterai/recorder locks it while recording.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isaudio - Audio only.
    * isvideo - Camera and microphone.
    * slides - Whether a slide deck may be added.
    * limits - The length and size limits sentence.
    * visualdisclosure - Whether still frames are taken, so the disclosure shows.
    * visualoptout - Whether to offer the body language opt out.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "isaudio": false,
        "isvideo": true,
        "slides": true,
        "limits": "Record for between 5:00 and 7:00. The largest recording this site accepts is 150 MB.",
        "visualdisclosure": true,
        "visualoptout": true
    }
}}
<div class="mod-presenterai-recorder card p-3 mb-4" data-region="recorder">
    <p class="mod-presenterai-limits small mb-2">{{limits}}</p>
    {{#visualdisclosure}}
    <p class="mod-presenterai-visual-disclosure small mb-2" data-region="visual-disclosure">{{#str}}visual_disclosure, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
    {{/visualdisclosure}}
    {{#visualoptout}}
    <div class="mod-presenterai-visualoptout form-check mb-3">
        <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="mod-presenterai-visualoptout-{{uniqid}}" data-region="visualoptout" aria-describedby="mod-presenterai-visualoptout-note-{{uniqid}}">
        <label class="form-check-label" for="mod-presenterai-visualoptout-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}visualoptout_label, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</label>
        <p class="mod-presenterai-visualoptout-note small mb-0" id="mod-presenterai-visualoptout-note-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}visualoptout_note, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
    </div>
    {{/visualoptout}}
    {{#slides}}
    <div class="mod-presenterai-deck mb-3">
        <label for="mod-presenterai-deck-{{uniqid}}" class="font-weight-bold d-block">{{#str}}deck_label, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</label>
        <input type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" id="mod-presenterai-deck-{{uniqid}}" class="form-control-file" data-region="deck-input">
        <div class="mod-presenterai-deck-status small mt-1" data-region="deck-status"></div>
        <div class="mod-presenterai-slides mt-2" data-region="slide-viewer"></div>
    </div>
    {{/slides}}
    {{#isvideo}}
    <video class="mod-presenterai-preview mb-2" data-region="preview" playsinline muted></video>
    {{/isvideo}}
    {{#isaudio}}
    <div class="mod-presenterai-audio d-flex align-items-center mb-2">
        <span class="mod-presenterai-mic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>{{#str}}rec_audio_only, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</span>
    </div>
    {{/isaudio}}
    <div class="mod-presenterai-controls d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center mb-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="record">{{#str}}record, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="stop" disabled>{{#str}}stop, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
        <span class="mod-presenterai-timer font-weight-bold" data-region="timer">0:00</span>
        <span class="mod-presenterai-rec-indicator" data-region="recording-indicator" hidden>{{#str}}rec_status_recording, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</span>
        <span class="mod-presenterai-near-max-text" data-region="near-max" hidden>{{#str}}rec_near_max, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mod-presenterai-status" data-region="status"></div>
    <div class="mt-2" data-region="retry" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="retry">{{#str}}rec_retry, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
